OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATories would prevent long-term jobless
OL,4,Aspending benefits on alcohol and
OL,5,Acigarettes
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis reduced rate would be paid onto a
OL,8,F"Back to Work" card, which would not
OL,9,Fallow cash withdrawals or spending on
OL,10,Fthese items.
OL,12,FThe Tories said the proposals were
OL,13,Fdesigned to encourage people back into
OL,14,Fwork and cut the soaring welfare bill
OL,15,Fbut Labour branded the scheme
OL,16,F"unworkable".
